## Source Data

This dataset is derived from the French ADEME RGE (Reconnu Garant de l'Environnement) public registry available at https://data.ademe.fr/datasets/liste-des-entreprises-rge. ServicesArtisans (https://servicesartisans.fr) augments the raw ADEME records with:

- Canonical URL pointing to the public artisan profile on ServicesArtisans.fr
- AI-generated E-E-A-T compliant descriptions (rubric v1.3+) per Google's Search Quality Evaluator Guidelines
- INSEE code resolution for each provider's municipality

The ADEME baseline is published under Etalab 2.0; the SA-authored
descriptions and SA canonical URLs are SA's own work, jointly released
here under CC-BY 4.0.

## Considerations for Using the Data

### Personal Information

This dataset contains business entity information (SIRET/SIREN) of registered French RGE-certified contractors. SIRET/SIREN are public identifiers under French commercial law (data.gouv.fr Etalab 2.0 default).

Per ServicesArtisans CLAUDE.md policy (decision 2026-05-07), only RGE-certified contractors with active qualifications are exposed in this dataset. Non-RGE providers are deliberately excluded to preserve their privacy.

No telephone numbers are exposed in this dataset.

### Bias and Limitations

- **Geographic bias**: French RGE contractors only. Not applicable outside metropolitan France + DROM.
- **Qualification recency**: dates `date_debut` and `date_fin` reflect ADEME registry as of `last_updated`. Real-world status may have changed since.
- **Description quality**: AI-generated descriptions are rubric-scored but not human-reviewed at scale. Descriptions are intended as machine-readable summaries, not editorial endorsements.
- **Coverage gap**: ~49 228 active RGE providers as of the latest snapshot; the ADEME registry refreshes weekly and trails real-world certifications by 1-4 weeks.

